Ohhh, what am I to do?{be01}
We were on our walk, Peeko and I, when
we were jumped by an odd thug...{be01}
The scoundrel made off with my
darling Peeko!{be01}
Wrrrooooooaaaar! Peeko!

Nnn... Roar!
What’s going on?{be01}
I was digging the tunnel without any
tools when some goon ordered me out!{be01}
That tunnel’s filled with Pokémon
that react badly to loud noises.{be00}
They could cause an uproar.{be01}
That’s why we stopped using heavy
equipment for tunneling...{be01}
I’m worried that the goon will do
something stupid and startle the{be00}
Pokémon into an uproar.

啊，是你！你就是那个在橙华森林里
帮过我，又替我追回了被偷的包裹，{be01}
然后好心地把它送到凯那市去的人！
楠木馆长告诉我们包裹已经平安到达{be01}
了！非常非常感谢！在下对您的感谢
如同滔滔江水连绵不绝又如黄河泛滥{be01}
一发不可收拾……大英雄啊！我给你这最
优秀的训练家带来了个好消息！最近{be01}
我们公司开发出一种新的精灵球，我
们把它送给你，就当作我们对一个杰{be01}
出的训练家的感谢！

Hmm...
These are Blackglasses.{be00}
They’re not what I’m looking for...{be01}
Maybe my glasses aren’t around
here...
